SPECIAL PROVISIONS FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES

This Software processes sensitive financial data and payment transactions. Users must:

1. Maintain PCI-DSS compliance if handling card data
2. Implement RBI-mandated security controls
3. Maintain transaction logs for statutory period (minimum 10 years)
4. Report suspicious transactions as per PMLA requirements
5. Comply with KYC/AML regulations
6. Maintain business continuity and disaster recovery plans
7. Obtain necessary licenses/approvals from regulatory authorities

